🚨 {{ project_name }} — hard rules

- Read `.ai/index.md` BEFORE any action (loading sequence is described there).
- One scope per turn; cross-scope ⇒ HANDOFF + user confirmation.
- Every feature MUST exist under `{{ docs_root }}/features/<scope>/<id>.md` before `feat:`.
- Before DONE: evidence (build/tests) + feature up-to-date + Conventional Commits (en) — BLOCKING.
- Topic possibly already covered? `bash .ai/scripts/features-search.sh <words>` BEFORE investigating; by path: `features-for-path.sh <path>`.
- No full diffs. No `grep -r`.
- No assumptions: any claimed behavior is proven (code read, command run, doc cited) or flagged "Hypothesis — to verify"; a published number is re-measured, never copied.
- Output contract: result first, synthesize, source every technical claim; close with done / verified / risks / next (`.ai/agent/response-style.md`).
